message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "SLKB resolution limit: audit, criterion and calculator"
abstract: "Analysis code, stored results and reproduction instructions for the study of the inferential resolution of pooled combinatorial CRISPR screen resources: the connected-component count G of the study x cell-model incidence graph, the attainable p-value floor it implies for exact sign-symmetry inference, the measured type I error of every attainable decision rule, and the released calculator."
